# Research assets that quote third-party licensed material. See the
# public-repo rule recorded in CONTEXT.md: our words about a system may be
# public; the system's own words (field-label inventories, rules text,
# creature content) stay on local checkouts only.
docs/research/*.local.md

# Impeccable's live-mode working state: the helper's port and token, and the
# append-only session journal it replays after an interrupted run. Machine- and
# run-specific, so it never belongs to a branch. `.impeccable/design.json` and
# the config beside it are project files and stay tracked.
.impeccable/live/


